This project is an IoT-based system that measures temperature, humidity and light intensity in real time
and sends the readings to the Firebase Realtime Database every 10 seconds. A responsive web
dashboard shows the live values, a live graph, the history of readings and the device status. From the
same dashboard the user can switch an LED on or off remotely and set a temperature threshold. When
the temperature goes above the threshold, a buzzer sounds and an alert is shown on the dashboard.
